WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.740
Language sits on the left in most people.

2
00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:10.360
But how most? And what does handedness tell you about one person?

3
00:00:11.483 --> 00:00:16.343
One study measured healthy adults with ultrasound probes over each temple, while

4
00:00:16.343 --> 00:00:17.343
they generated words.

5
00:00:18.417 --> 00:00:22.277
The side whose blood flow rises more is scored as language-dominant.

6
00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:27.930
Right-sided language appeared in about four of every hundred strong right-handers.

7
00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:31.370
It appeared in more than a quarter of strong left-handers.

8
00:00:32.333 --> 00:00:35.133
So most strong left-handers still speak with the left.

9
00:00:36.053 --> 00:00:39.053
Left-handedness raises the odds of right-sided language.

10
00:00:39.973 --> 00:00:41.033
It does not make it typical.

11
00:00:42.117 --> 00:00:46.497
Now take equal numbers of strong right-handers and strong left-handers.

12
00:00:47.177 --> 00:00:48.597
Pick one right-dominant person.

13
00:00:49.477 --> 00:00:51.237
Is that person probably left-handed?

14
00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:01.720
Yes. Most right-dominant people in this mix are left-handers.

15
00:01:04.183 --> 00:01:06.663
Yet most left-handers are not right-dominant.

16
00:01:07.583 --> 00:01:08.903
These are two different questions.

17
00:01:09.983 --> 00:01:12.983
Now change only the base rate, the share of each group.

18
00:01:13.883 --> 00:01:15.783
Make it nine right-handers in every ten.

19
00:01:16.603 --> 00:01:17.703
The rates stay the same.

20
00:01:18.683 --> 00:01:22.583
Now fewer than half of the right-dominant people are left-handed.

21
00:01:22.583 --> 00:01:25.903
Right-handers are so many that they supply most of them.

22
00:01:26.817 --> 00:01:29.517
Same rates, different base rate, different answer.

23
00:01:30.517 --> 00:01:34.037
So for one person, handedness gives odds, not an answer.

24
00:01:34.957 --> 00:01:38.637
Before epilepsy surgery, the side of language has been tested directly.

25
00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:42.100
Which hemisphere speaks is a probability.

26
00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:46.060
Left-handedness shifts the odds without reversing them.
